comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T00:05:13.668Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check searched all statuses for stale anonymous registry visibility,workflow-dispatch access stabilization,hidden-package recovery,and npm private state. pm-7zs0 is the recurring release-health parent; closed pm-2z9263 fixed identity drift and conditional recovery but does not own post-verification visibility regression. No duplicate implementation item was found."
  "2026-07-31T00:10:17.205Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: workflow_dispatch exact-tag recovery now calls the authenticated public-access repair before anonymous metadata probes; E404 remains a guarded first-publication path, non-404 access failures stop, normal tag-push behavior is unchanged, and existing immutable versions skip publication. Linked executable fake-registry and workflow contracts pass 30/30. Typecheck, ESLint, jscpd zero clones, static/docstrings 100%, package boundary/parity, token budgets, SDK surface/import-cost/transport floors, docs/skills, and diff checks pass."
  "2026-07-31T00:31:48.707Z","harness:codex","Live post-merge evidence: exact-tag recovery run 30593451032 checked out immutable v2026.7.30 and stopped before npm mutation because that historical source contains the now-expired July 1 context-eval feedback timestamp (6539/6540 tests passed). Recovery must execute the reviewed current main workflow/source while treating the existing version as immutable and refusing dispatch-time publication if it is absent."
  "2026-07-31T00:34:53.824Z","harness:codex","Second-stage correction evidence: manual exact-tag recovery now checks out the reviewed dispatch SHA from main rather than historical tag source, while RELEASE_TAG remains the immutable verification target. Dispatch restores access first and then refuses publication if the exact public version is absent; original tag-push runs retain first-publication behavior. Executable publication guard and workflow contracts pass 30/30; typecheck, docs/skills, ESLint, zero clones, 100% static/docstrings, package/SDK/token/gate registry/surface/import/transport gates pass. Local actionlint is unavailable, so the pinned hosted actionlint check remains the YAML validator."
  "2026-07-31T00:41:13.178Z","harness:codex","Review-fix evidence for PR #835: Greptile correctly identified that github.sha follows the UI-selected dispatch ref and that unconditional source-version equality blocks older-tag recovery. Dispatch now hard-selects repository default branch, validates tag shape while retaining source-version equality only for tag pushes, and still cannot publish. CodeRabbit's ordering concern is fixed with fail-closed presence assertions and explicit access-repair < exact-version-probe < dispatch-refusal < package-probe ordering. Focused executable/workflow contracts remain 30/30; typecheck and docs/skills pass."
